    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<color=#ffd34d>MOVE & FIGHT</color>   WASD move  \xB7  Mouse aim  \xB7  Left click shoot  \xB7  R reload  \xB7  Q rally nearby troops\n<color=#ffd34d>BUILD</color>   1 Barricade  \xB7  2 Soldier  \xB7  3 Tower  (left click place, right click cancel, scroll rotates)\n<color=#ffd34d>COMMAND</color>   Left click a unit/building to select it  \xB7  Right click ground: move & hold  \xB7  X release  \xB7  U upgrade  \xB7  F send nearby soldiers\n<color=#ffd34d>MANAGE</color>   4 Order food  \xB7  5 Hire miner  \xB7  M select the mine  \xB7  Tab shop  \xB7  Esc deselect / pause\n\nDesert (west): open ground, rocks block bullets.   Forest (east): raiders stay hidden until close or firing."
